{"format":"midnight-mint/collection","version":1,"name":{"es":"El Senado","en":"The Senate"},"theme":{"accent":"#c2639a","background":"#150e13","surface":"#21171e","text":"#efe8dc","muted":"#b6a8ae","glow":"#4b1838","font":"Marcellus"},"brand":{"logo":"/collections/senado-logo.svg"},"loader":{"text":{"es":"Convocando al Senado…","en":"Convening the Senate…"}},"about":{"text":{"es":"Fichas para jugar a un juego de roles ocultos en el Senado de Roma. La mayoría son Republicanos y no saben quién es quién; los Conspiradores se conocen entre ellos; el Aspirante a César, su líder, se esconde. El Cónsul nombra a un Tribuno y todos votan a la vez (Placet / Non placet); si sale adelante, entre los dos aprueban una ley; con tres gobiernos fallidos estallan los Tumultos y se aprueba la ley de arriba del mazo. Al acabar su mandato, el Cónsul y el Tribuno se dan la vuelta (Excónsul, Extribuno). Ganan los Republicanos con 5 Leyes de la República o ejecutando al Aspirante a César; los Conspiradores, con 6 Decretos del Tirano o si el Aspirante a César es nombrado Tribuno con 3 decretos ya aprobados. El mazo: 6 Leyes y 11 Decretos, en tarjetas.","en":"Tokens to play a hidden-role game in the Roman Senate. Most players are Republicans and don't know who is who; the Conspirators know each other; the Aspiring Caesar, their leader, stays hidden. The Consul names a Tribune and everyone votes at once (Placet / Non placet); if it passes, the two of them enact a law; three failed governments spark Unrest and the top law of the deck passes. When their term ends, the Consul and the Tribune turn over (Ex-Consul, Ex-Tribune). The Republicans win with 5 Laws of the Republic or by executing the Aspiring Caesar; the Conspirators, with 6 Tyrant's Decrees, or if the Aspiring Caesar is named Tribune once 3 decrees have passed. The deck: 6 Laws and 11 Decrees, as cards."},"credits":{"es":"Basado en Secret Hitler, de Goat, Wolf & Cabbage (Max Temkin, Mike Boxleiter y Tommy Maranges), con licencia CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. Esta adaptación, con la temática del Senado de Roma y nombres propios, se comparte con la misma licencia y sin fines comerciales. No es oficial ni está afiliada a Goat, Wolf & Cabbage ni respaldada por ellos. Iconos de game-icons.net (CC BY 3.0).","en":"Based on Secret Hitler by Goat, Wolf & Cabbage (Max Temkin, Mike Boxleiter and Tommy Maranges), licensed CC BY-NC-SA 4.0. This adaptation, rethemed to the Roman Senate with names of its own, is shared under the same licence, for non-commercial use. It is unofficial, and not affiliated with or endorsed by Goat, Wolf & Cabbage. Icons from game-icons.net (CC BY 3.0)."},"links":[{"label":"Secret Hitler","url":"https://www.secrethitler.com"},{"label":"CC BY-NC-SA 4.0","url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/"},{"label":"game-icons.net","url":"https://game-icons.net"}]},"languages":["es","en"],"types":[{"id":"fichas","name":{"es":"Fichas","en":"Tokens"},"title":{"es":"Fichas","en":"Tokens"},"shape":"coin","icon":"laurel-crown"},{"id":"leyes","name":{"es":"Leyes","en":"Laws"},"title":{"es":"Leyes","en":"Laws"},"shape":"card","icon":"scroll-unfurled"}],"groups":[{"id":"republica","name":{"es":"La República","en":"Republic"},"colour":"#ece9e2","iconBody":"<path d=\"M256 26.2L52 135h408zM73 153v14h366v-14zm16 32v206h30V185zm101.334 0v206h30V185zm101.332 0v206h30V185zM393 185v206h30V185zM73 409v30h366v-30zm-32 48v30h430v-30z\"/>"},{"id":"conjura","name":{"es":"La Conjura","en":"Conspiracy"},"colour":"#b3191e","iconBody":"<path d=\"M43.53 15.75c-15.73 0-28.31 12.583-28.31 28.313c0 14.086 10.092 25.644 23.5 27.906L42.687 68L68.81 41.906l2.626-2.625C69.188 25.86 57.63 15.75 43.53 15.75m33.72 44.125l-17 17c15.885 39.37 43.45 66.684 78.75 87.406a513 513 0 0 1 25.438-24.936c-22.488-35.103-51.535-62.294-87.188-79.47M322.594 79.03l-51.25 4.314c-79.356 48.134-143.878 108.1-186.72 186.53l-4.31 51.47l44.155-18.656l-2.94-34.094l-.25-3.063l1.626-2.624c35.94-58.47 79.93-109.41 141.5-141.25l2.406-1.25l2.688.25l34.